    "html": "<article class=\"blog-post\">\n <header class=\"post-header\">\n <h1>Exploring CSS Grid for Modern Layouts</h1>\n <div class=\"post-meta\">\n <span class=\"author\">By Alex Johnson</span>\n <time datetime=\"2023-10-12\">October 12, 2023</time>\n </div>\n </header>\n <section class=\"post-content\">\n <p>The CSS Grid Layout Module provides a powerful way to create two-dimensional layouts on the web...</p>\n </section>\n <footer class=\"post-footer\">\n <section class=\"comments-section\">\n <h2>Leave a Comment</h2>\n <form aria-label=\"Comment form\" class=\"comment-form\" novalidate>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n <label for=\"name\">Name:</label>\n <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required aria-required=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"nameError\">\n <span id=\"nameError\" class=\"error-message\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n </div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n <label for=\"email\">Email:</label>\n <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required aria-required=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"emailError\">\n <span id=\"emailError\" class=\"error-message\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n </div>\n <div class=\"form-field\">\n <label for=\"comment\">Comment:</label>\n <textarea id=\"comment\" name=\"comment\" required aria-required=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"commentError\"></textarea>\n <span id=\"commentError\" class=\"error-message\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n </div>\n <button type=\"submit\">Post Comment</button>\n </form>\n </section>\n </footer>\n</article>\n\n<style>\n .blog-post {\n width: 60%;\n margin: 0 auto;\n font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n }\n .post-header, .post-footer {\n border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;\n padding-bottom: 10px;\n }\n .post-meta, .comments-section {\n margin-top: 20px;\n }\n .form-field {\n margin-bottom: 15px;\n }\n label {\n display: block;\n font-weight: bold;\n }\n input, textarea {\n width: 100%;\n padding: 8px;\n border: 1px solid #ddd;\n border-radius: 4px;\n }\n .error-message {\n color: red;\n font-size: 0.875em;\n }\n</style>",
